Cburnett chess pieces
=====================

Author: Colin M.L. Burnett (Wikimedia Commons user Cburnett)
Licence used here: BSD 3-Clause (one of the author's offered licences)
Retrieved: 2026-11-21, by the chess-improver project
Decision: docs/decisions/0039-piece-set.md

The twelve SVG files in this directory are the unmodified originals from Wikimedia
Commons. Each file page carries the author's licence tag
{{self|GFDL|migration=relicense|BSD|GPL}}, so the author offers the drawings under
the GFDL 1.2+, CC BY-SA 3.0 (by migration), the 3-clause BSD licence (Commons
{{BSD}} defaults to version 3) or the GPL 2+. This project uses them under the
BSD 3-Clause licence only. No copy from Lichess or any other redistributor was used.

Sources (file page, then the original file it served):

