SHA-256 of the files as committed. The repository stores text with LF line
endings (.gitattributes), and Commons served five files (Chess_bdt45, Chess_blt45,
Chess_ndt45, Chess_nlt45 and Chess_rlt45) with CRLF, so for those five the hash is
of the LF-normalised bytes; the drawing data is unchanged:

  3ed2bb19629a70ddb8d0f971caa7251b0ab9bf01bcebaa4bac83f7aec0c6dd7a  Chess_bdt45.svg
  30612a7aec659cd417d9bf258281c9d681896d7eacc3066fe1808cbb180d588a  Chess_blt45.svg
  025eea92e0ef8eb1fd06b1c58d0d112948f08bf66cea6b5d003659569949b41c  Chess_kdt45.svg
  56f55c784843b1ac272b8745d740aa2a3e6c585513ef889978916f88e5d0b70b  Chess_klt45.svg
  9b836351ecb399c64163b5e5083d17b67c1b7273728a369847ba8b1332ca243d  Chess_ndt45.svg
  3b5d668e3caf7856d3c9c496d73c4b36d095cfda482929097defd7dbade20bc4  Chess_nlt45.svg
  4413bf7c18a341f9723d97e6f92c985e30b6167b037e80842cea59b7541bb074  Chess_pdt45.svg
  cc7de30708dcec8f4d593a89d10893d5f9c063682039a1c441e86c44cf2096db  Chess_plt45.svg
  70191a3fbc729ef629661e2419a66ab8024c49277aab8ccae3a5ef61372ab802  Chess_qdt45.svg
  b72b864e2a5b6c8f8afb7f260130c10e649ff063f4ef58190c00a35c56364327  Chess_qlt45.svg
